      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "Thanks for your feedback. I'd like to make sure I understand your issue.\n\nIt should be possible to add a contact receiver to an avatar, and a contact sender to a world, such that the avatar can respond when its receiver enters the world's sender. If I'm reading your request correctly, this seems to already cover what you're asking for?\n\nIs there a particular case you're trying to achieve that isn't covered by that approach?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
